        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-40163-40705"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40166-40187"><rb>當時</rb><rt>たうじ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40187-40211"><rb>寫眞</rb><rt>しやしん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40211-40214">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40214-40226"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40226-40235">た――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40235-40247"><rb>湯</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40247-40250">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40250-40268"><rb>都</rb><rt>みやこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40268-40280">は、たゞ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40280-40295"><rb>泥</rb><rt>どろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40295-40298">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40298-40316"><rb>瓦</rb><rt>かはら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40316-40319">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40319-40334"><rb>丘</rb><rt>をか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40334-40364">となつて、なきがらの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40364-40379"><rb>如</rb><rt>ごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40379-40382">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40382-40397"><rb>山</rb><rt>やま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40397-40412">あるのみ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40412-40436"><rb>谿川</rb><rt>たにがは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40436-40439">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40439-40457"><rb>流</rb><rt>ながれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40457-40463">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40463-40478"><rb>大</rb><rt>おほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40478-40490">むかでの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40490-40505"><rb>爛</rb><rt>たゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40505-40526">れたやうに……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40526-40538"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40538-40541">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40541-40565"><rb>寫眞</rb><rt>しやしん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40565-40568">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40568-40583"><rb>赤</rb><rt>あか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40583-40586">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40586-40601"><rb>濁</rb><rt>にご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40601-40610">る……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40610-40637"><rb>砂煙</rb><rt>すなけむり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40637-40640">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40640-40664"><rb>曠野</rb><rt>くわうや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40664-40667">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40667-40679"><rb>這</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40679-40685">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40685-40697"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40697-40705">た。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-40705-40940"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40708-40720"><rb>木</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40720-40723">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40723-40738"><rb>草</rb><rt>くさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40738-40756">も、あはれ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40756-40780"><rb>廢屋</rb><rt>はいをく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40780-40783">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40783-40798"><rb>跡</rb><rt>あと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40798-40801">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40801-40825"><rb>一輪</rb><rt>いちりん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40825-40828">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40828-40849"><rb>紫</rb><rt>むらさき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40849-40852">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40852-40873"><rb>菖蒲</rb><rt>あやめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40873-40915">もあらば、それがどんなに、と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40915-40930"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40930-40940">ふ。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-40940-41062"><seg source="#source-40940-40949">――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40949-40964"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40964-40970">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40970-40988"><rb>柳</rb><rt>やなぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40988-40991">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40991-41006"><rb>芽</rb><rt>めぐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41006-41030">んだであらう――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41030-41054"><rb>城崎</rb><rt>きのさき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41054-41062">よ。</seg></p>
